    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leap into <i>SAGE</i>, a multiplayer adventure game about frog wizards. <br>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join other fledgling mages in your adventure guild on a mission to become a SAGE. Help build mushroom villages, collect unique resources, complete bounties, learn spells, level up gear, and sip fragrant teas with fellow adventurers.<br>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing social guild with daily magic classes and bounties!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day night cycle with regular global events!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect creatures of different elemental type and rarity!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of cosmetic items to make your frog stand out!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plenty of unique NPCs who need your help!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of objects with faces (even if they shouldn\u2019t)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434920/extras/7daf726e277e90eb5a4740cdbaf257fa.avif?t=1755151633\" data-has-big width=800 height=181 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leap into <i>SAGE</i>, a multiplayer adventure game about frog wizards. <br>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join other fledgling mages in your adventure guild on a mission to become a SAGE. Help build mushroom villages, collect unique resources, complete bounties, learn spells, level up gear, and sip fragrant teas with fellow adventurers.<br>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing social guild with daily magic classes and bounties!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day night cycle with regular global events!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect creatures of different elemental type and rarity!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of cosmetic items to make your frog stand out!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plenty of unique NPCs who need your help!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of objects with faces (even if they shouldn\u2019t)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434920/extras/7daf726e277e90eb5a4740cdbaf257fa.avif?t=1755151633\" data-has-big width=800 height=181 /></span></p>",
